<Base title="Contact | LakeLevelData" description="How to contact LakeLevelData about a lake level, a missing lake or a correction.">
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p>Spotted a reading that looks wrong, or want a lake added? Email <strong>hello at lakeleveldata dot com</strong>. Please include the lake name and the source reading if you have it.</p>
  <p>For official information about releases, closures or boat ramps, contact the agency that operates the lake (listed on each lake page).</p>
</Base>
